          // Wrapping the two samples in a HorizontalLayoutWidgetClass sidesteps that: it lays out
          // children left-to-right with no slot/weight requirements, so it survives Workbench's save
          // and actually renders side-by-side. Delete this whole wrapper once real PopulateItems()
